elli in hot water for 5 minutes and drain them.","timer":null},{"text":"Grate the carrot and peel the prawns.","timer":null},{"text":"Dip a rice paper sheet in lukewarm water for a few seconds and lay it flat.","timer":null},{"text":"Fill with lettuce, vermicelli, carrot and mint, then 2 prawns cut in half.","timer":null},{"text":"Fold in the sides and roll up tightly. Serve with the hoisin sauce.","timer":null}],"makes":{"n":8,"one":"roll","many":"rolls"}},{"title":"Soupe au pistou","intro":"The Provençal soup of summer vegetables and beans, with its basil pistou.","minutes":60,"calories":380,"difficulty":"Facile","imageSearch":"soupe au pistou","veg":true,"oven":false,"cold":false,"missing":"","origin":"Provençal speciality","serves":4,"items":[{"name":"courgette","plural":"courgettes","qty":2,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"green bean","plural":"green beans","qty":200,"unit":"g","have":false},{"name":"white bean","plural":"white beans","qty":400,"unit":"g","have":false},{"name":"potato","plural":"potatoes","qty":2,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"carrot","plural":"carrots","qty":2,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"tomato","plural":"tomatoes","qty":2,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"small pasta","plural":"small pasta","qty":80,"unit":"g","have":false},{"name":"basil","plural":"basil","qty":null,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"garlic","plural":"garlic","qty":3,"unit":"clove","have":false},{"name":"parmesan","plural":"parmesan","qty":50,"unit":"g","have":false},{"name":"olive oil","plural":"olive oil","qty":6,"unit":"tbsp","have":false}],"steps":[{"text":"Cut all the vegetables into small dice.","timer":null},{"text":"Put them in 2 litres of salted water and cook for 30 minutes.","timer":{"label":"Cooking","min":30}},{"text":"Add the drained white beans and the pasta, and leave for 10 minutes.","timer":{"label":"Cooking","min":10}},{"text":"Pound the basil, the garlic, the parmesan and the olive oil together: this is the pistou.","timer":null},{"text":"Stir in the 